json
cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,news,medium,"What is the primary focus of the Envision Radiology's acquisition of Rezolut?","Expansion of Envision Radiology's geographic reach and market consolidation within the imaging industry.",Radiology Business,news;mergers;acquisition
  card_002,journal,hard,"According to a study in European Radiology, what imaging parameter was found to predict survival in patients with pulmonary metastases from sarcoma?","Baseline CT imaging parameters, suggesting their importance in prognosis.",European Radiology,journal;sarcoma;metastasis;CT
  card_003,news,easy,"What is the RSNA looking for in their search for a new editor?","A new editor for the journal 'Radiology: Cardiothoracic Imaging'.",Radiological Society of North America | RSNA,news;editing;cardiothoracic
  card_004,news,medium,"A recent petition to the FDA proposes an alternative method for detecting fractures. What imaging modality is it focused on?","CT scans, specifically for cervical spine fractures.",SpringerLink,news;FDA;cervical spine;CT
  card_005,journal,hard,"What is the key benefit demonstrated by using digital variance angiography during prostatic artery embolization?","Up to an 80% reduction in stationary acquisition radiation dose.",European Radiology,journal;prostatic artery embolization;radiation dose;digital variance angiography

# Added on 2026-01-09
json
cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,news,medium,"What is the significance of Envision Radiology's acquisition of Rezolut?","This acquisition represents consolidation in the imaging industry, likely increasing Envision Radiology's market share and potentially impacting referral patterns and access to imaging services in the acquired regions.",Google News Radiology;news;industry consolidation;referral patterns,
  card_002,news,medium,"Why is the search for a new editor for 'Radiology: Cardiothoracic Imaging' important?","The journal is a prominent publication, and a new editor can bring updated perspectives and priorities, potentially influencing research and clinical practice in cardiothoracic imaging.",Google News Radiology;news;journal editing;cardiothoracic imaging;RSNA,
  card_003,ir,hard,"What is the main clinical implication of the FDA petition regarding cervical spine fracture detection on CT?","The petition proposes an alternative approach for detecting cervical spine fractures on CT, potentially leading to changes in CT protocols for trauma patients and improved detection of subtle injuries.",link.springer.com;FDA;cervical spine;CT;trauma,
  card_004,msk,medium,"What is the focus of the study on prostate volume, PI-RADS, and PSA density?","The study investigates the relationship between prostate volume, PI-RADS category, and optimal PSA-density thresholds for prostate biopsy, aiming to refine current guidelines and potentially reduce unnecessary biopsies.",Eur. Radiology;prostate cancer;PSA density;PI-RADS;biopsy,
  card_005,ir,medium,"How does digital variance angiography impact radiation dose during prostatic artery embolization?","A prospective study shows that digital variance angiography can reduce radiation dose during prostatic artery embolization by up to 80%, offering a safer alternative for this procedure.",Eur. Radiology;interventional radiology;radiation dose;prostatic artery embolization;digital variance angiography

# Added on 2026-01-09
json
cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,neuro,hard,"Which imaging modality is most sensitive for detecting acute intracranial hemorrhage, particularly in the setting of subtle bleeds?","Non-contrast Computed Tomography (CT) is the gold standard for rapid detection of acute intracranial hemorrhage due to its high sensitivity for blood products.",Digest;Hemorrhage;CT;Neuro
  card_002,general,medium,"What is a key clinical utility of digital variance angiography (DVA) in interventional radiology procedures?","DVA allows for a significant reduction in radiation dose during stationary image acquisitions, enhancing patient safety during procedures like prostatic artery embolization.",Digest;DVA;Radiation Dose;Interventional Radiology
  card_003,pulmonary,hard,"In patients with pulmonary metastases from soft tissue or bone sarcoma, what baseline CT imaging parameters have been shown to predict overall and progression-free survival?","This study identified parameters such as tumor size, number of lesions, and involvement of specific lung regions as prognostic factors on baseline CT imaging.",Digest;Pulmonary Metastases;Sarcoma;Prognosis;CT
  card_004,cardiology,medium,"What is the primary goal of quantifying net water uptake on non-contrast CT in the acute setting of ischemic stroke?","Quantifying net water uptake helps to differentiate between different types of acute ischemic stroke and can provide prognostic information regarding infarct core size and potential for reperfusion.",Digest;Stroke;Water Uptake;CT;Diagnosis
  card_005,news,easy,"What recent business development highlights a trend in the radiology industry?","Envision Radiology recently acquired Rezolut, a private equity-backed imaging center operator, indicating continued consolidation within the radiology market.",Digest;Industry News;Mergers & Acquisitions;Consolidation

