json
cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,research,hard,"A generative AI system showed superior accuracy in identifying subtle abnormalities in blood cells indicative of diseases like leukemia. What is the primary clinical implication of this finding?","Improved diagnostic accuracy and potential for earlier detection of hematologic malignancies, aiding clinicians in timely intervention.",ScienceDaily Health,AI;hematology;diagnostics;leukemia
  card_002,news,medium,"AdventHealth Murray recently received accreditation from which organization, signifying a commitment to high standards in medical imaging?","American College of Radiology (ACR)",AdventHealth,radiology;accreditation;quality;patient care
  card_003,research,medium,"Despite existing guidelines, a significant number of dementia patients continue to be prescribed medications associated with increased risks of falls and confusion. What is the most critical concern associated with this practice?","Increased morbidity and potential for adverse events in a vulnerable patient population.",ScienceDaily Health,dementia;medication safety;fall risk;confusion
  card_004,news,easy,"What does the acquisition of Women's Center for Radiology by Solis Mammography likely indicate about the radiology market in the affected region?","Increased market consolidation and potential shifts in referral patterns.",PR Newswire,business;consolidation;market dynamics;referrals
  card_005,research,hard,"Research suggests scientists have gained insights into the biological mechanisms governing uterine contractions during childbirth. What clinical area does this research most directly impact?","Obstetric imaging and management of labor and delivery complications.",ScienceDaily Health,obstetrics;labor;contractions;imaging

