cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,research,hard,"What is the key finding of the ScienceDaily Health article regarding post-meal blood sugar and brain health?","Elevated post-meal blood sugar is associated with a higher risk of Alzheimer’s disease, suggesting novel biological pathways are involved.",ScienceDaily Health,metabolic health;Alzheimer's;postprandial glucose
  card_002,research,medium,"According to the ScienceDaily Health article, what is the mechanism by which statins may cause muscle pain?","Statins can trigger a calcium leak within muscle cells, leading to muscle pain.",ScienceDaily Health,statins;myopathy;calcium leak
  card_003,research,medium,"What is the newly discovered rare type of diabetes in newborns, and what complications are often associated with it?","This diabetes is caused by a single gene mutation affecting insulin production and often presents with neurological complications.",ScienceDaily Health,newborn diabetes;genetics;neurological complications
  card_004,research,medium,"The ScienceDaily Health article highlights a study questioning the safety of what common food packaging component?","Bisphenol A (BPA) and its substitutes.",ScienceDaily Health,BPA;packaging;health risks;endocrine disruptors
  card_005,news,easy,"What significant financial agreement has Radiology Associates of North Texas recently established?","A $29 million enterprise agreement with Verity Health.",Google News Radiology,hospital administration;clinical partnerships;enterprise agreement

