  card_002,research,medium,"A recent UK study suggests a potential benefit of statin use in individuals with type 2 diabetes. What is the primary finding of this study regarding cardiovascular events?","Statin use was linked to fewer deaths and cardiac events across all risk levels of type 2 diabetes.",ScienceDaily Health,"diabetes;statin;cardiovascular"
