  card_005,research,medium,"What specific post-meal metabolic event is being investigated for its potential link to an increased risk of Alzheimer's disease, even in the absence of visible brain damage?","High post-meal blood sugar spikes.",ScienceDaily Health,"alzheimer's;diabetes;metabolic"

