cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,neuro,hard,"What is the newly identified key trigger of tau protein accumulation implicated in Alzheimer's disease?","OTULIN, an immune-regulating enzyme, is now recognized as a primary driver of tau buildup in the brain.","ScienceDaily Health",neuro;Alzheimer's;pathology;OTULIN
