cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,news,medium,"What is the main finding regarding patient comfort with AI in mammography interpretation, according to the Utsouthwestern study?","A significant majority of patients are comfortable with AI assisting in mammogram interpretation when a radiologist retains oversight.",Google News Radiology;news;AI;mammography,patient comfort
  card_002,news,medium,"What strategy is being implemented to address the radiologic technologist shortage, as highlighted in the Medical University of South Carolina article?","Apprenticeship programs are being utilized to provide a pathway for individuals to enter the field.",Google News Radiology;news;radiologic technologists;apprenticeships,workforce
  card_003,research,hard,"According to the ScienceDaily article, what new weakness have scientists identified in deadly fungi?","Researchers have identified a novel weakness in deadly fungi, offering a potential pathway to revive existing antifungal medications.",ScienceDaily Health;research;fungal infections;antifungals,drug resistance
  card_004,research,medium,"What does the MRI study show about the effects of regular aerobic exercise on the brain?","Regular aerobic exercise can lead to changes in brain structure, making it appear biologically younger.",ScienceDaily Health;research;exercise;brain plasticity,cognitive health;MRI
  card_005,research,medium,"What is the newly explained mechanism linking kidney disease to cardiac complications, according to the ScienceDaily article?","Damaged kidneys release particles that actively harm the heart, contributing to the increased risk of cardiac problems in kidney disease.",ScienceDaily Health;research;kidney disease;cardiac complications,mechanisms

