cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,ai,medium,"What is the main finding of the survey regarding patient acceptance of AI in mammography interpretation?","Patients show strong support for AI assisting in mammogram reading, *with the crucial condition* of a radiologist maintaining oversight.",UT Southwestern,"AI;mammography;patient acceptance;oversight"
  card_002,nephrology,hard,"What association was highlighted in the study linking blood test discrepancies to adverse outcomes?","Discrepancies between creatinine and cystatin C blood tests are significantly associated with an increased risk of kidney failure, heart disease, and mortality.",ScienceDaily Health,"kidney failure;cystatin C;creatinine;mortality"
  card_003,neurology,hard,"Which gene is implicated in potentially explaining a significant proportion of Alzheimer's disease cases?","The APOE gene is strongly associated with Alzheimer's disease, potentially explaining up to 90% of cases.",ScienceDaily Health,"Alzheimer's;APOE gene;genetics"
  card_004,ir,medium,"What is a significant challenge discussed in the interview regarding Interventional Radiology?","The interview highlights the critical issue of diversity and resident attrition within the field of Interventional Radiology.",Google News Radiology,"Interventional Radiology;diversity;resident attrition;workforce"
  card_005,oncology,medium,"What is the promising role of the newly developed antibody in breast cancer treatment?","The antibody demonstrates promise in targeting and destroying chemotherapy-resistant triple-negative breast cancer cells, leading to slowed tumor growth and reduced metastasis in early trials.",ScienceDaily Health,"triple-negative breast cancer;antibody;metastasis"

