cards[1]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_002,news,hard,"Why is the Stanford Radiology/Radiology Partners AI partnership significant?","It directly addresses a key barrier to AI implementation in radiology: safety and reliability, which is crucial for clinical adoption and addressing potential risks.", "Stanford Medicine", "AI safety; AI reliability; radiology workflow; clinical implementation"

cards[2]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_003,news,medium,"What does Premier Radiology Services' acquisition of NRAD indicate about the current trend in radiology?","Expansion of teleradiology capabilities and increased access to remote interpretation services.", "Business Wire", "teleradiology; radiology access; remote interpretation; workflow optimization"

cards[3]{id,category,difficulty,hard,"According to the ScienceDaily article, what lifestyle factor may be associated with slower cognitive decline?","Grandparents who provide childcare appear to have better memory and verbal skills, suggesting caregiving may be protective.", "ScienceDaily Health", "cognitive decline; aging; lifestyle factors; neurocognitive health"

cards[4]{id,category,difficulty,medium,"What is the key finding regarding long-term alcohol use and rectal cancer based on the ScienceDaily article?","Long-term heavy alcohol consumption is significantly linked to a sharp increase in rectal cancer risk.", "ScienceDaily Health", "rectal cancer; alcohol; cancer risk factors; epidemiology"

