cards[5]{id,category,difficulty,front,back,source,tags}:
  card_001,news,hard,"What significant trend is highlighted by the news of a major radiology practice dissolving its partnership before a new contract ends?","It suggests potential shifts in the hospital-radiology business model and evolving market dynamics.",Radiology Business,"teleradiology;hospital-radiology;business model;news"
  card_002,news,medium,"Premier Radiology Services' acquisition of NRAD indicates a growing trend in which area within radiology?","Continued growth and investment in the teleradiology sector, aiming to enhance access to radiology services.",Business Wire,"teleradiology;acquisition;market expansion;access"
  card_003,research,medium,"Regarding collagen supplements for skin health, what is the primary conclusion of recent research?","Solid evidence does not support their use for improving skin appearance, and potential safety concerns exist.",ScienceDaily Health,"collagen;skin health;supplements;evidence"
  card_004,research,hard,"What is the key finding regarding the experimental diabetes drug IC7Fc in its research phase?","It has shown promise in reducing cholesterol, blood fats, artery plaques, and calming inflammation, suggesting a potential new therapeutic avenue for cardiovascular disease.",ScienceDaily Health,"diabetes drug;IC7Fc;cardiovascular disease;inflammation;research"
  card_005,research,medium,"What novel mechanism of metastasis has been identified in pancreatic cancer research?","The cancer reprograms its surroundings, particularly through the protein periostin, to facilitate spread.",ScienceDaily Health,"pancreatic cancer;metastasis;periostin;pathogenesis;research"